# ── TLS dev certificates — PRIVATE KEYS, never commit ────────────────────────────
# app/.certs holds ca.key and dev.key. House rule: "NEVER commit .certs — the keys are
# local secrets." Regenerate with openssl if the Mac's LAN IP changes.
app/.certs/

